        "entry_WJchnF": {
          "type": "entry",
          "settings": {
            "full_width_enable": false,
            "title": "Can a turbo trainer fan replicate real-life windspeeds?",
            "text": "<p>Nothing beats a strong wind outdoors for keeping you cool, but the right fan, positioned correctly, can get very close. The key is to look for a turbo training fan with the highest directional speed you can find. Look for the actual km or mph specification and don't go for anything less than 45 km per hour - which is the equivalent to a strong wind. </p>",
            "button_1_style": "white",
            "button_1_text": "",
            "button_1_url": "",
            "button_2_style": "white",
            "button_2_text": "",
            "button_2_url": "",
